Flight plan

## You brief once. We build, run and report.

1. ### Brief

   Tell us what takes up your time and what a good result looks like.
2. ### Build

   We set up the system, connect your tools and test it on real tasks.
3. ### Run

   It works on its own schedule and flags anything that needs a decision.
4. ### Review

   You approve the output, we tune the system, and the next run gets better.

Open channel

## Tell us what to automate.

Send a short note on the work you want off your plate. We reply with what we would build and how long it takes.

